{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ulo3q58j","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":64,"top":225,"width":500,"height":370},"text":"GET muestra la confirmación.\nPOST revisa los préstamos activos.\nSi existen, informa y vuelve a la lista.\n\nSin préstamos asociados, elimina el perfil y la cuenta.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#172D39","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5czmpk76","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":620,"top":225,"width":596,"height":380},"text":"Caso a revisar\n\nUn préstamo finalizado también\npuede impedir borrar User.\n\nEl modelo usa PROTECT.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":31,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#006B64","alignment":"left"}}
